## Basic Usage

```tsx
import { [ComponentName] } from 'components/[ComponentName]';

function MyComponent() {
  return (
    <[ComponentName]
      prop1=\"value1\"
      prop2={value2}
      onEvent={handleEvent}
    />
  );
}
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Required | Description |
|------|------|---------|----------|-------------|
| prop1 | `string` | `'primary'` | Yes | [Prop description] |
| prop2 | `SomeType` | `undefined` | No | [Prop description] |
| onEvent | `(event: Event) => void` | `undefined` | No | [Event handler description] |

## Examples

### Basic Example

```tsx
